{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15473","headline":"下第上薛侍郎 · 李端","name":"下第上薛侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蓬荜春风起，开帘却自悲。\n如何飘梗处，又到采兰时。\n明镜方重照，微城寄一辞。\n家贫求禄早，身贱报恩迟。\n幸得皮存矣，须劳翼长之。\n铭肌非厚荅，肉骨是前期。\n纵觉新人好，宁忘旧主疑。\n终慙太丘道，不爲小生私。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15473.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15473","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}